{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:36:07.707Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\nSummary:\n- Added `crates/kernel/config/src/roles/` with `Harness`, `ExecutorConfig`, `PlannerConfig`, `ValidatorConfig`, their named defaults, and pure table readers built on the existing `pub(crate)` value readers.\n- `Config` now carries the three role settings; `parse_config` reads them after `vcs`, with the planner following the executor when `[planner]` is absent.\n- Added `tests/roles.rs` covering all five role scenarios row by row, plus two mutation-coverage tests.\n- `cargo test -p osq-kernel-config --test roles` passes, per-file `cargo mutants` caught or marked unviable every mutant, and `sh scripts/verify-rust.sh` exits 0.\n- Result written to `openspec/changes/252-rust-config-kernel/.run/results/2.md`."}}
